This folder contains patches for Kerberos 5 to work with wolfSSL. Patches make it
easier to add support for newer versions of a target library. Instructions for 
applying each patch are included in the patch commit message.


The newest patch, Patch-for-Kerberos-5-1.22.2.patch, is tested by the
wolfSSL krb5 GitHub workflow (.github/workflows/krb5.yml) against
krb5-1.22.2-final.
